  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Boogie Woogie — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You were born with a simple although tricky ability to swap places with your opponents with a clap.</p></blockquote><p>At 1st level, you have created a unique technique to switch places with your others, extremely simple yet effective. You can switch places with a willing creature or magical object within 30 feet of you by clapping for 1 Cursed Energy. You can use this technique as an action or bonus action, or you can also swap as a reaction for 2 additional Cursed Energy.</p>",
